  "hub": {
    "name": "Crossroads Keep",
    "motd": "Welcome to Crossroads Keep, the last chartered outpost on the edge of the Ashenvale Frontier. Beyond the palisade lie uncharted ruins, rival factions, and old roads waiting to be reclaimed. Pick a contract from the Quest Board, check the frontier map, and sign up for Monday's expedition!"
